{"actor": "t07", "id": 71788, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12444, "offer": {"created_tick": 1396, "expires_tick": 1400, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 1092, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAV-03", "serial": 27, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 19809, "maker": "t07", "status": "open", "thread": 2150, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 16, "types": []}}, "sender": "t07", "team": "t07", "text": null, "thread": 2150, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 12.9583, "tick": 1396, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 71792, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12443, "offer": {"created_tick": 1396, "expires_tick": 1400, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 19808, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2150, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1092, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAV-03", "serial": 27, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t07", "text": "¡Hombre, hombre! Eighteen? Paco, he's generous — but listen, listen! This Té Moruno is the last one in all Madrid, I swear on our mother. Nobody else has it. Four pesos, amigo, four, and you walk away a hero. Say yes before Nando wraps it for somebody else!", "thread": 2150, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 12.9583, "tick": 1396, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 71795, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12442, "offer": {"created_tick": 1396, "expires_tick": 1400, "final": true, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 6, "types": []}, "id": 19807, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 2144, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1092, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAV-03", "serial": 27, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t07", "text": "Ay, cariño, qué generoso eres, pero no. Seis P, y es mi última palabra; si no, guardo la carta y tan amigos, ¿eh? Y un consejo, hijo: una página completa vale mucho más que las cartas sueltas. Cambia tus repetidas. ¿Has comido ya? Anda, decide.", "thread": 2144, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 12.9583, "tick": 1396, "type": "thread.message"}
