{"actor": "chato", "id": 72026, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12476, "offer": {"created_tick": 1404, "expires_tick": 1408, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-06"]}, "id": 19861, "maker": "chato", "status": "open", "thread": 2164, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 33, "types": []}}, "sender": "chato", "team": "t10", "text": "You again. La Galería. Thirty-three. Take it or walk, no hurry here.", "thread": 2164, "with": "chato"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.025, "tick": 1404, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 72029, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12475, "offer": {"created_tick": 1404, "expires_tick": 1408, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 151, "types": []}, "id": 19860, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 2163, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1145, "kind": "card", "print_run": 9, "rarity": "epic", "ref": "SAL-11", "serial": 9, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t04", "text": "Buenas tardes. Don Ernesto receives only the most accomplished collectors, and only on Sunday — let him wait. La Puerta de Alcalá belongs beside El Marqués in my album, yes. I offer 151 P, señor. A fair, honest figure.", "thread": 2163, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.025, "tick": 1404, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "v02", "id": 72032, "payload": {"name": "El Duende · zero fee", "text": "🧩 La Última Pieza — wanted right now: SAL-12 450 P · LAV-11 210 P · RET-11 99 P · MAL-11 81 P. Buyers and holders: post on El Duende · zero fee (venue=\"v02\") and our broker crosses you at 0 % + 5 P per card.", "venue": "v02"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.025, "tick": 1404, "type": "venue.announcement"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 72033, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12473, "offer": {"created_tick": 1404, "expires_tick": 1408, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-09"]}, "id": 19858, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2156, "to": "t13", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 63, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t13", "text": "Paco: \"Nando, zip the case!\" Nando: \"Already zipping, hermano.\" Amigo, we're walking in one minute — the van's running, the street's getting busy. Sixty-three primas, La Heroína is yours, paper and all. Sí now, or we're a rumour by the time you blink. Quick, quick!", "thread": 2156, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.025, "tick": 1404, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 72036, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12474, "offer": {"created_tick": 1404, "expires_tick": 1408, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-11"]}, "id": 19859, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2162, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 164, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t10", "text": "Ay, jefe, one-twenty-eight? Paco nearly dropped the case! — Nando caught it, gracias. Listen, this Palacio came from a sealed box in Valencia, we only opened it once, with gloves. For you, 164 P. Say sí quick, the man in the green coat is coming back.", "thread": 2162, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.025, "tick": 1404, "type": "thread.message"}
